[/p][previewyoutube="5OEMZ7B7wYo;full"][/previewyoutube][p][/p][h3]Changelog[/h3][h3]New Feature: Restore vegetation with shovels[/h3][p]· Added a right click action on shovels which restores vegetation on the targeted spot;[/p][p]· This should allow to reduce the "browness" caused by build sites;[/p][p]· Growing trees paint the terrain with forest texture around them;
[/p][p][img src="{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43222048/e0a5d25d57a96bb2dabcfd297ab6cab2c29e9720.gif"][/img][/p][h3]New feature: Job-based clothing color templates[/h3][p]· you can now setup equipment coloring rules for villagers at their workplace;[/p][p]· If there is paint available in the settlement, the villagers will paint their equipment accordingly in their leisure time;[/p][p]· Painting clothing items has been simplified. Clothing can be now dyed in the inventory;[/p][p][/p][h3]New Feature: Settlement Log[/h3][p]· Added a new Settlement Log system that keeps track of various key events that happened in game;[/p][p]· The log goes back up to 4 in-game days. The limit exists because of network and storage concerns;[/p][p]· Added the Barbecue to settlement overview menu;[/p][p]· You can now open the structure menu for Markers form the Map Menu;[/p][p][/p][h3]New Decorations and Furniture[/h3][p]· Added new decorations: Ivy Fence, Tall Ivy Fence, Ivy Arch. Ivy fences provide no defense and don't count as walls.[/p][p]· Added new furniture designed for the Longhouse: Sturdy Bed, Sturdy Wall, Sturdy Doorway, Hearth, Sturdy Food Storage, Sturdy Weapons and Tools Rack, Sturdy Firewood Storage, Sturdy Table[/p][p]· Previous storages can be upgraded to the newer versions;[/p][p][img src="{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43222048/76bba9d5521f106b778451d056603326117a3907.gif"][/img][/p][h3]Improved Villager cleanup behavior[/h3][p]· Workers crafting stations no longer get stuck if their station inventory is full;[/p][p]· When cleaning up their inventory, villagers use other storages to deposit instead of dropping things on the ground;[/p][p]· Warehouse workers no longer bring more items than the container capacity resulting in many items dropped on the ground;[/p][p][/p][h3]New Items[/h3][p]· Added a new Fine Linen Cape;[/p][p]· Added boots for the Bulwark set; [/p][h3]Fixes[/h3][p]· Fixed Winter invasion timer being incorrect after saving a loading a dedicated server;[/p][p]· Fixed an issue where the map structure icon border color would not match the icon border color displayed on the compass and map;[/p][p]· Fixed a fisherman infinite loop when fishing grounds were off season but not depleted;[/p][p]· Fixed giant forestry trees;[/p][p]· Fixed cape not coloring on Ragnar;[/p][p]· Fixed durability bar appearing on items without decay;[/p][p]· Fixed an issue where villagers would sometimes get stuck in animations on a client after going far away from them and then coming back to them;[/p][p]· Fix invalid click sound when changing network region;[/p][p]· Fixed Steadfast Resolve not offering immunity to Work and Sleep Anxiety;[/p][p]· Fixed separator furniture not having collision;[/p][p]· Fixed some Huskarl and Hauberk armor items not giving resources back when destroyed;[/p][p]· Fixed a navigation issue causing miners to get stuck at the entrance;[/p][p][/p][h3]Dog Fixes[/h3][p]· Dogs no longer get bored from combat while attacking;[/p][p]· Dogs follow moving guard targets more closely;[/p][p]· Dogs can eat from other storages if starving;
